        field {
            name = "dma_trans_size";
            desc = "DMA transfer length. Before a DMA transfer, write the length of the data to be transferred to this register. The minimum transfer length is 1 byte and the maximum is 4 GB. During the DMA transfer, the value of this register decrements automatically. The register value is the number of bytes not yet transferred; after a successful transfer completes, this register is 0.";
