        field {
            name = "dma_dar_low";
            desc = "Destination address (low 32 bits) of the DMA transfer. Write the destination address to this register before the DMA transfer; the DMA channel writes the data fetched from the source address to the destination address. During the DMA transfer, the value of this register increments automatically. The low 2 bits of this register must be 0.";
